ersonal style and family needs. </span></p></span><div class=\"hp-sec-cta__cta-wrapper\">\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-4 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-widget_1700183892292\">\n<div class=\"hp-mini-cta hp--clearfix hp-mini-cta--align-c\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-right: 15px; \"><div class=\"hp-cta hp-cta--primary-solid hp-cta--full-width\">\n<a class=\"hp-cta_button\" href=\"/en-ca/request-a-quote\" title=\"Button Request A Quote\">Request A Quote</a>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_1700183898956\">\n<div class=\"hp-mini-cta hp--clearfix hp-mini-cta--align-c\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-right: 15px; \"><div class=\"hp-cta hp-cta--regular-solid hp-cta--full-width\">\n<a class=\"hp-cta_button\" href=\"mailto:sales@hipelpools.ca\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Button Talk To Sales\">Talk To Sales</a>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span cell_17001832584945-vertical-alignment dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span widget_1700183730306-flexbox-positioning\">\n<div id=\"m-widget_1700183730306\">\n<span id=\"m-widget_1700183730306_\"><img alt=\"Landscapers in kitchener-waterloo offering landscaping services\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/shutterstock-719379529-1.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"Landscapers in kitchener-waterloo offering landscaping services\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-6 dnd_area-row-2-force-full-width-section dnd_area-row-2-padding dnd-section\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapp